        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Funimal” is a turn-based sliding puzzle you move the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And <strong><i>&lt; you can always clear in 5 moves or fewer! &gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Think deeply, solve instantly!”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funimal</strong> is a turn-based slide puzzle designed with a simple goal in mind: to be &quot;just right&quot; for everyone, regardless of age or gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The true charm of the game lies in its intuitive controls paired with the &quot;perfectly balanced challenge&quot; of finding the optimal solution within limited moves. Experiment with your fields and help lead <strong>Funimal</strong> to the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/24022dbddf616d768ccabde42acddb65.avif?t=1777002809\" width=1024 height=190 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>How to is simple! Just move it ↑ or ←!</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply select the ground you want to move and slide it vertically or horizontally?it's that easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no time limit, so you can take your time without feeling rushed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/a2b4958c9002501c6ca0cfa83101b041.poster.avif?t=1777002809\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/a2b4958c9002501c6ca0cfa83101b041.webm?t=1777002809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/a2b4958c9002501c6ca0cfa83101b041.mp4?t=1777002809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/7d495b76ef7e4ff9fef50451319b72b3.avif?t=1777002809\" width=1024 height=190 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>What is a Funimal?</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're a creature still shrouded in mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One known characteristic is that “when two Funimals of the same type stick together, they fuse and transform </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >into a new Funimal!”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/c8f7f96dd1cefbea61790f1b12e77457.poster.avif?t=1777002809\" width=1024 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/c8f7f96dd1cefbea61790f1b12e77457.webm?t=1777002809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One goal, two Funimal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In such cases, you have to FUSE them before leading them to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the field smoothly to lead the Funimal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/4993e8095f947039051016665dc9b86c.poster.avif?t=1777002809\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/4993e8095f947039051016665dc9b86c.webm?t=1777002809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/4993e8095f947039051016665dc9b86c.mp4?t=1777002809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/217498c3c45832c9e78a8177568920ee.avif?t=1777002809\" width=1024 height=190 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The story proceeds as your CATCH</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pokke and Pikke are here to support you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you CATCH Funimal, the more new information and new places you'll discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever there's a new discovery, it seems they'll let you know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please enjoy CATCHING together with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/7debaae6819e59e1b5bbfd6e40fff73d.poster.avif?t=1777002809\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/7debaae6819e59e1b5bbfd6e40fff73d.webm?t=1777002809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/7debaae6819e59e1b5bbfd6e40fff73d.mp4?t=1777002809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/8435b8b036d4fcc48dba0d079a215bd1.avif?t=1777002809\" width=1024 height=190 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>No worries if puzzles aren't your thing!</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most stages can be cleared in just 3 moves,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >making it easy to think things through repeatedly and plan ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's enjoyable regardless of gaming experience or age!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even so, stuck and can't figure it out...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If that happens, try Redoing it a few times, and Pikke will give you a “Hint”!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...That said, the further you progress, the harder it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle pros will definitely enjoy it too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/bcf1647d28b130c02265fb329426c0e8.avif?t=1777002809\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/c6d09d976eb0f6f1a685b52580cda7ac.avif?t=1777002809\" width=1024 height=190 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Encyclo of Living things</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can check detailed info on the Funimals you've CATCHED in the encyclopedia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully CATCHING them seems to unlock more details to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why don’t you browse the encyclopedia relaxing between CATCHES?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/b5895309d65606abd66bd8d035fe660d.poster.avif?t=1777002809\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/b5895309d65606abd66bd8d035fe660d.webm?t=1777002809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031390/extras/b5895309d65606abd66bd8d035fe660d.mp4?t=1777002809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
